 **Parameters**
 *   $T$: Tile size for partitioning the image plane on the CPU. Default value is 32 [S1, unofficial].
-*   $\alpha_{\max}$: Maximum alpha scaling factor. Range $(0, 1]$ [S1, unofficial].
